The exact release archive and checksum are recorded in share/jq/source.txt.

Pyxis builds the unmodified jq 1.7.1 release sources as one static program,
with decNumber (number literals keep their precision) and without Oniguruma,
so the regular-expression builtins are unavailable. See the recipe README for
the functions and builtins Pyxis libc does not provide. No host libc, source
patches or compatibility stubs are included.
